{"title":"2005 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/c/d6c16d422cbde15830325df2ac4d160c43a71cb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-5, \\frac{3}{2}, 2, \\frac{3}{5}, 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" /> is larger than its square?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/3/253990d725c51cfcb449aac1fca50f28002386c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ -5 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\frac{3}{2} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\frac{3}{5} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"418\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can calculate the squares of the values of the numbers and compare them to the number itself:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/7/207b38ae62117c5b0941b1817e8b2b9672ee06e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-5)^2 = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"89\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/1/801e2099cd8d0efac872f74ee403a8b5a02af581.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-5) &lt; 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"82\" height=\"20\" />, so it is not the answer\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/0/bc0342a4ac8548665d39b0c99f5d75f77e4c5fce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{2} = 1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f1361e633d47978d00662cd514d64a59f31d52e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{3}{2})^{2} = \\frac{3^2}{2^2} = \\frac{9}{4} = 2.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"175\" height=\"41\" />. We can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b10b1301b69698ed4ac3ee86f5dfbe01bac6e632.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5 &lt; 2.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />, so it is not the answer\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/b/8cb0e6e64d73bacef9c8869039bc21581f1884e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" />. We can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/0/0d031dd1e1e06e5864431ceb63e4ef3e73baa522.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 &lt; 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, so this is not the answer.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/1/b0197b31800d25219af748e30e7caebd2d1a15b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{5} = 0.6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"62\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb899520371b197b55895a3bffbe3eabdbefcf43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{3}{5})^2 = \\frac{3^2}{5^2} = \\frac{9}{25} = 0.36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"184\" height=\"41\" />. We can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/0/1f094768d921deaeddcb8962bf4506217f8049ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.6 &gt; 0.36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/3/40394b0af0b5b00fad84ded9df1cfad65e14e120.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } \\frac{3}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"62\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28answer_choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(answer_choices)\">Solution 2 (answer choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (answer choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Without having to calculate the squares of the values of the numbers, we can notice that the square of a number is only less than the number itself when the number that is being squared is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (exclusive).\n</p><p>We can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/4/ac40ce1434cda0943c408cc185f5976212d95801.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> is the only number that matches this, as the numerator is less than the denominator. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/3/40394b0af0b5b00fad84ded9df1cfad65e14e120.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } \\frac{3}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"62\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017205545\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 85/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3352/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32902:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017205545 and revision id 253609. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}